gametitle=Ibara (Japan) (SLPM-66301)
// Ibara Complete RESEARCH ONLY | original ELF XOR CRC 420C7FAB
// PNACH changes EE RAM at runtime; DOES NOT add a BLACK LABEL mode.
// Uses the clean retail executable, NOT a pre-patched 240p ELF.
// WARNING: Enable ONE test at a time; video tests and rank tests conflict.
// See tests/manual/RESULTS_P01_P02.md for the PCSX2 video results.
// Injected-code profile: enable alone, cold boot, temporary memory card.

[Ibara Complete\K01 BLACK LABEL / XTC graze counter (+10 per graze)]
description=Kuro BL graze: holding shot 5+ frames near enemy bullets adds 10 points per bullet. State at 000C0000: magic XTC1, then per player quarters(s32)/timer(u16)/held(u8). Run only after C00 passes. No HUD counter yet. RUNTIME UNTESTED.
author=Ibara Complete Research
